      "type": "understanding",
      "summary": "Agent explained goal and mechanics.",
      "understanding": {
        "goal_understanding": "Navigate each grid level to reach and complete all goal cells. A goal cell only completes when the carried piece matches that goal\u2019s required shape, color, and rotation at the moment you step onto it; completing every goal in the level advances to the next, and finishing all levels wins.",
        "mechanics_understanding": "Movement is turn-based on a grid with walls blocking certain directions (listed each turn as blocked_directions, which should never be attempted). Each move costs 1 stamina; when stamina hits 0 you lose 1 life and stamina resets to max, and losing all lives ends the game. Stepping on modifier tiles changes the carried piece: shape changers cycle shapes 0\u20135 (wrapping), color changers cycle colors in order orange\u2192blue\u2192green\u2192red\u2192orange, and rotation changers rotate 90\u00b0 clockwise through 0\u00b0\u219290\u00b0\u2192180\u00b0\u2192270\u00b0\u21920\u00b0. A goal activates only when shape+color+rotation all match simultaneously, and stepping onto an activated goal completes it."
      }
